fish_name = "Movie Snob Fish"
grade = 2
sprite = ExtResource("2_vr88a")
catch_blurb = "Its opinion matters more than yours."
description = "★☆☆☆☆

“‘It’s just a kids movie, don’t criticize it!’ That’s exactly why it should be criticized. These kids are the future generation, and movies are pieces of art. We should be careful with what we consume, especially what we show little kids.

On the surface, ‘The King Fisher’ biopic is fun. The songs are catchy, the animation is colorful, and the characters are all bubbly. But it doesn’t go deeper than that, and that’s the problem.

The King Fisher is the most inspirational person in the universe because of his hard and humble beginnings, but in the film, the King Fisher is almost infallible. He’s constantly happy, and always befriends those he encounters—another point for the plague that is ‘friendslop,’ I suppose! Any King Fisher truther knows that this squandered retelling is far from accurate! He was ostracized for being a Pwaaga born with just one arm instead of the usual four, but despite that, he became the greatest angler in the universe. NONE of that struggle is brought to light here! He has ALL. FOUR. ARMS!

Kids should watch this movie and yearn for the fishing pole, not friendship and fun! This movie is a DISGRACE—do NOT show this to your kids!“

"
